    {
      "q": "What is coquette aesthetic?",
      "a": "Coquette is a soft, feminine French-inspired aesthetic (think bows, lace, and pink) popular on TikTok and Instagram. \"Dollette\" is a more doll-like, hyper-feminine variant of coquette, like the dark coquette symbols on this page."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is there a coquette font or text style, not just symbols?",
